{"id": "DfUkm4ENgv3", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Ek Pandav ne Ramayan ke do vanaron se saat din yuddh kiya. Kaun sa Pandav, aur Dvivida ka ant kaise hua? Follow karo.\n\nMahabharat, Sabha Parva, adhyay 30. Rajasuya yagya se pehle Sahadev dakshin ki vijay par nikle. Kishkindha mein unka saamna hua vanar-raja Mainda aur Dvivida se. Saat din yuddh chala, vanar thake nahi, aur aakhir mein prasann hokar unhone Sahadev ko bhent di.\n\nYe wahi Mainda aur Dvivida the jo Ram ki sena mein Lanka mein lade the.\n\nBhagavat Puran (10.67) ke anusaar Narakasur Dvivida ka mitra tha. Krishna ne Narakasur ko maara to Dvivida badla lene nikla. Raivatak parvat par Balram ne use maara.\n\nHanuman Bhim se mile aur Arjun ke rath ki dhwaja par rehne ka vachan diya (Vana Parva 150). Vanar kaise khatam hue, iska kisi granth mein zikr nahi milta.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Episode 7. Ep 06 profile par hai.\n\n#mahabharata #ramayan #hanuman #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793799529, "like_count": 5448, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1841837096992492a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.16, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMD0K14mPucckFYLAkM7yWPEVzgopjrOwY0xKDDl_14ZuAXOs9FJiMLmfPCEU1zY9tTVQplEG4BYub0EPMTWcLzmcKUIFoAkDjn4YU.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdqxvIZj4Q6XVIsSJL3arq5I95KYm0IE8MMLAaaUF6WP0bY40Rca98Nc9a6nQGaxupb9CVGKOHRDnKOivXGGrozR&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=FvtpGi